Cortex Command's changes to LuaBridge3, against upstream commit 64b3ec3d265578c742abd5d3939b133353952718.
They're described in CortexCommandChanges.md. To apply them to a fresh copy of upstream, run this from the root of the repository:
    git apply external/include/LuaBridge3/CortexCommandChanges.patch

